Smart Classroom Comfort Monitor

Our temperature monitor will display temperature readings to the screen with a label of "Normal" or "Warning" depending on the range requirements.
  Readings that are out of range will trigger the LED light to turn on.
  Temperature readings will be displayed on the screen as well as saved to a file. 
  Readings will be taken from user input and range validated using a function created outside of main.
  This function will compare the input using a conditional statement and return true or false.
  The led function will be written outside of main.
